stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Reviewing: Submit valid revision
    Reviewing --> NeedsClarification: Missing or blocking findings
    Reviewing --> ReadyForApproval: Valid review without blockers
    Reviewing --> ReviewError: Provider or validation failure
    ReviewError --> Reviewing: Explicit retry
    NeedsClarification --> Draft: Save corrected revision
    ReadyForApproval --> PartiallyApproved: First lead approves
    PartiallyApproved --> Approved: Second lead approves same revision
    ReadyForApproval --> NeedsClarification: Lead requests changes
    PartiallyApproved --> NeedsClarification: Lead requests changes
    Approved --> BriefReady: Generate immutable brief
    ReadyForApproval --> Draft: Requirements changed
    PartiallyApproved --> Draft: Requirements changed
    Approved --> Draft: Requirements changed
    BriefReady --> Draft: Requirements changed
    Reviewing --> Draft: Requirements changed during review
